{"version":"1","id":"planetxamarin","handle":"planetxamarin","name":"Planet Xamarin","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/e173520ec80446be9176a8451b5901e3","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-6.6165,"y":1.4459,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":356,"newest_post_at":"2024-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","oldest_post_at":"2019-05-20T13:44:46.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.044944,"listicle_ratio":0.002809,"question_ratio":0.019663,"avg_read_time":4.114695,"summary_length_avg":248.631944,"title_length_avg":50.893258,"title_length_var":426.904337,"tag_entropy":3.522165,"tag_diversity":0.297753,"top_tag_share":0.241573,"avg_upvotes":1.129213,"median_upvotes":1.0,"avg_comments":0.042135,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.039702,"zero_engagement_share":0.41573,"viral_share":0.0,"posts_per_week":2.44985,"non_article_ratio":0.050562,"author_present_share":0.014045,"recency_skew":0.126582},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-3.0,1.9853],"cadence_depth":[7.3088,-4.3676],"hype_variety":[8.0,3.5294],"title_style":[0.7059,0.1176]},"top_tags":[[".net",208],[".net-maui",152],["xamarin",92],["android",77],["ios",74],["mobile",50],["windows",50],["mac",39]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["Full customizable Tabs for MAUI",".NET MAUI : Runs on multiple platforms in one project (iOS, Android, and Windows)","\ud83d\udd34 Recreating Threads App with .NET MAUI & NEW VS Code Extension!"],"outlier":["This blog post will focus on Xamarin.Forms as it covers a wide range of platforms and doesn't include the 2D graphics engine"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"FwZr20nXm","title":"Cross-Platform App Development is Dead, Long Live Cross-Platform App Development!","url":"https://blog.pieeatingninjas.be/2024/05/02/cross-platform-app-development-is-dead-long-live-cross-platform-app-development/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cross-platform-app-development-is-dead-long-live-cross-platform-app-development--fwzr20nxm","summary":"Xamarin, a tool for cross-platform app development, has been officially archived, marking the beginning of a new era with .NET MAUI. The migration to .NET MAUI is expected to have its challenges, but it offers enhanced features and expands on Xamarin's foundational concepts. The future of cross-platform development looks promising with technologies like .NET MAUI.","image":"https://i0.wp.com/blog.pieeatingninjas.be/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/XamarinMaui.webp?fit=1024%2C1024&ssl=1","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"BqwvzcUU3","title":"So Long, and Thanks for All the Fish; Xamarin End of Support","url":"https://almirvuk.com/so-long-and-thanks-for-all-the-fish-xamarin/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/so-long-and-thanks-for-all-the-fish-xamarin-end-of-support-bqwvzcuu3","summary":"Xamarin support has ended, but Microsoft has introduced a new project called .NET MAUI for building native apps on multiple platforms.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e6b22061c1e3537900b16af96ad808a1?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-01T23:42:11.000Z"},{"id":"bOYIGbf70","title":"104: The one about XAML!","url":"https://www.gonemobile.io/104","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/104-the-one-about-xaml--boyigbf70","summary":"The post covers topics related to coffee-making methods and the use of XAML in app development. It discusses preferences for coffee machines, the debate between logic in view model or view, converters in XAML, benefits of compiled bindings, and challenges of XAML-heavy apps in Blazor.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/467136f235b401f1e35045224d67af47?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-26T19:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"JHq9Q0EFT","title":"Push Notifications in Safari Progressive Web apps","url":"https://iwritecodesometimes.net/2024/04/23/push-notifications-in-safari-progressive-web-apps/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/push-notifications-in-safari-progressive-web-apps-jhq9q0eft","summary":"Learn how to add push notifications to a web application using Safari's new-ish browser APIs in this post. The post covers the steps to add a service worker, configure its behavior, register it with the web app, and send both local and remote push notifications. It also discusses the caveats and considerations when developing push notifications for web apps.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4800c5572f7a883b81016c0ea4197a6b?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"ZFsY3xk2m","title":"Detect Long Press in Your .NET MAUI App with TouchBehavior","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBsTCvfZ_XQ","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/detect-long-press-in-your-net-maui-app-with-touchbehavior-zfsy3xk2m","summary":"Learn how to detect a long press in your .NET MAUI app using TouchBehavior. The TouchBehavior has been migrated from Xamarin to .NET MAUI Community Toolkit, and it allows you to influence properties of visual elements in your app based on touch or clicks. Implementing a long press gesture can be useful for triggering actions like showing a menu, selecting multiple items, or navigating to the next page.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KBsTCvfZ_XQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-15T13:02:00.000Z"},{"id":"K1Shz0Pgg","title":"Introducing Syncfusion .NET MAUI Visual Studio Code Extension","url":"https://www.syncfusion.com/blogs/post/maui-visual-studio-code-extension","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/introducing-syncfusion-net-maui-visual-studio-code-extension-k1shz0pgg","summary":"Introducing the Syncfusion .NET MAUI Visual Studio Code Extension, a utility for adding Syncfusion .NET MAUI controls seamlessly to your apps using code snippets.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6e97e4f0d4d0257e6f96d5c0ec051670?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-09T17:14:48.000Z"},{"id":"fHGyAy3J0","title":"Passing data in .NET MAUI with Shell to a ViewModel #dotnet #dotnetmaui","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QOWzBDXuhE4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/passing-data-in-net-maui-with-shell-to-a-viewmodel-dotnet-dotnetmaui-fhgyay3j0","summary":"Learn how to pass data in .NET MAUI with Shell to a ViewModel. You can pass properties, attributes, and even entire objects between pages and view models effortlessly.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QOWzBDXuhE4/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-07T16:21:24.000Z"},{"id":"1U4jkXn5D","title":"Error Monitoring & Crash Reporting for .NET MAUI Apps with Raygun","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LZV1TApcG4Y","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/error-monitoring-crash-reporting-for-net-maui-apps-with-raygun-1u4jkxn5d","summary":"Learn how to integrate Raygun into .NET MAUI and Donet Maui hybrid applications for error monitoring and crash reporting.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LZV1TApcG4Y/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-04T13:00:29.000Z"},{"id":"XbOU9XXCT","title":".NET MAUI Community Standup \u2013 Developer Thoughts","url":"https://egvijayanand.in/2024/04/04/dotnet-maui-community-standup-april-2024/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/net-maui-community-standup-developer-thoughts-xbou9xxct","summary":"The .NET MAUI community standup this month will feature Gerald Versluis discussing Testing your MAUI Apps.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--0_ODbtD2--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2008","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"9qJjINkD8","title":".NET MAUI \u2013 Styles","url":"https://egvijayanand.in/2024/04/03/dotnet-maui-developer-tips-styles/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/ne